///   `QuasarMessage` is a giant union message with ~125 optional submessage fields (`1..251`).
///   Each IPC frame encodes its inner message directly under top-level field tag `<type_id>`
///   (for example, `remoting = 210` has wire tag `(210 << 3) | 2 = 0x0692` -> varint `92 0d`).
///
