///   Starting in `0.368+`, `maind` switched to `option optimize_for = LITE_RUNTIME` (stripping
///   `FileDescriptorProto` reflection tables from `.rodata` to save >20 MB RAM) and reserved
///   all legacy payload fields (`reserved 2 to 181, 183 to 235, 238 to 251`). Instead, every
///   `QuasarMessage` carries:
