///     UTF-8 bytes for `std::string` payloads such as `TYPE_SERVICE_NAME_READY = 157`), and
///   - `type = 253` (wire tag `0xe8 0x0f`, `varint`): `enum QuasarMessage::Type` discriminator
///     whose integer value is **strictly equal** to the legacy `QuasarMessage` field number
///     `<type_id>` (e.g. `TYPE_REMOTING = 210` -> varint `d2 01`).
